{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prop Haunt is a psychological horror 4v1 multiplayer game where you play as either a Ghost or an Investigator. As a Ghost, haunt objects, gather energy, and scare Investigators to stop them from identifying your haunted items. As an Investigator, use cameras to find haunted objects while dodging the Ghost\u2019s tricks\u2014like power outages, slowdowns, and terrifying scares. Outsmart your opponents in this thrilling, spooky game!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/d5cab4dbffca0ffcef8d4255e002008a.avif?t=1770907513\" width=616 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/a285c271743d1fc79f722a8ddc5f85c6.poster.avif?t=1770907513\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/a285c271743d1fc79f722a8ddc5f85c6.webm?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/a285c271743d1fc79f722a8ddc5f85c6.mp4?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Become the Investigator. Armed only with cameras, the investigator must scan rooms for signs of the paranormal. A chair moving on its own? A toaster floating? Every subtle sign matters in this supernatural showdown. Acquire power by zapping haunts to use the ultimate and stun ghosts or lock them in rooms temporarily to stop them from taking over. Survive the night to win!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/82a1e6cd3e99ad47a40f281240a8cd70.avif?t=1770907513\" width=616 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/12a5de18c371a820c39ba6fb053a5bf2.poster.avif?t=1770907513\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/12a5de18c371a820c39ba6fb053a5bf2.webm?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/12a5de18c371a820c39ba6fb053a5bf2.mp4?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join a ghoulish team. Join 3 other ghosts and rack up points by haunting as many objects as possible\u2014the more you haunt, the more powerful you'll become! But be careful\u2014if you make it too obvious, you'll only help the investigator. Stay one step ahead by teleporting between rooms, choosing the perfect objects to haunt without giving yourself away.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/32404a962b72dc9730b32cc8b41aa1cb.avif?t=1770907513\" width=616 height=272 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/9705a0106def11692ec38e6bf870dc4e.poster.avif?t=1770907513\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/9705a0106def11692ec38e6bf870dc4e.webm?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/9705a0106def11692ec38e6bf870dc4e.mp4?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The more haunted objects remain active, the more energy ghosts build. With enough power, they can mess with the investigator\u2014 turn off the power, open the garage door to slow down the investigation, and scare the hell out of them! Or use your power to destroy rooms and cut the investigator off from them for good.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/4431b7052705a29b4d1d210d59ca3aaf.avif?t=1770907513\" width=616 height=272 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/c953a5d6d0261c02433e8e7d1b603968.poster.avif?t=1770907513\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/c953a5d6d0261c02433e8e7d1b603968.webm?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960220/extras/c953a5d6d0261c02433e8e7d1b603968.mp4?t=1770907513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Once the ghosts have enough power, they can work together to destroy rooms so the investigator can no longer use their cameras there. With enough rooms destroyed, the ghost will take over and win the match!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MVP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2960220/1e1178d622fd07d97cbe74162fdc3ff977be3f4f.jpg"},{"name":"Rats!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2960220/b755ae3874354b548a3f334a6ede96cc0cfe001d.jpg"},{"name":"That's a Prop!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2960220/7444825f95b74a820ccfcb592ff82280da2c5d6f.jpg"},{"name":"This isn't my first summoning","path"